WEBVTT

00:16:29.411 --> 00:16:33.250
and we've committed to loving each other
throughout changes to gender

00:16:33.274 --> 00:16:34.842
and changes in spirit.

00:16:35.319 --> 00:16:37.942
And we learned this love
in our chat rooms,

00:16:37.966 --> 00:16:41.646
in our clubs, in our bars
and in our community centers.

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:44.404
We've learned how to love
each other for the long haul.

00:16:44.932 --> 00:16:46.104
TM &amp; KKM: Thank you.

00:16:46.128 --> 00:16:49.228
(Applause)